# Schema Reference

Quick reference so the agent doesn't have to re-read schema.prisma for every task.
The authoritative source is always `prisma/schema.prisma`.

## Entities and Key Fields

### Order
| Field | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| order_id | ID | PK |
| supplier_or_country | String | e.g. "China" |
| order_date | DateTime | |
| transportation_fee | Float | Lump business expense. Never touches item cost. |
| expected_bundle_count | Int | |
| status | Enum | `ongoing` \| `closed` |

### Bundle
| Field | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| bundle_id | ID | PK |
| order_id | ID | FK → Order |
| type | String | e.g. "Topset", "Kurthi" |
| design_name | String | e.g. "Rammaya" |
| items_ordered | Int | Set at creation, never changes |
| cost_per_item | Float | Fixed at order time |
| status | Enum | `pending` \| `arrived` \| `lost` \| `refunded` \| `replaced` |
| items_received | Int? | Null until arrival |
| arrival_date | DateTime? | Null until arrival |

### InventoryItem
| Field | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| item_id | ID | PK |
| bundle_id | ID | FK → Bundle |
| variant | String? | Size/color if items differ |
| cost_price | Float | **Copied from Bundle.cost_per_item at creation. Never changes.** |
| marked_price | Float? | Anchor/reference price |
| listed_price | Float? | Price shown to customer |
| target_price | Float? | Realistic expected selling price |
| floor_price | Float? | Minimum acceptable selling price |
| max_discount_percent | Float? | Warning threshold |
| status | Enum | `in_stock` \| `sold` \| `damaged` \| `returned` |

### Sale
| Field | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| sale_id | ID | PK |
| item_id | ID | FK → InventoryItem |
| sale_date | DateTime | |
| selling_price | Float | |
| profit | Float | `selling_price − cost_price`. Stored at sale time. |

### LossEntry
| Field | Type | Notes |
|---|---|---|
| loss_id | ID | PK |
| bundle_id | ID | FK → Bundle |
| loss_type | Enum | `full_bundle` \| `partial` |
| items_lost | Int | `items_ordered − items_received` |
| loss_value | Float | `items_lost × cost_per_item` |
| loss_date | DateTime | When loss was recorded |
| recovery_status | Enum | `none` \| `pending_claim` \| `refunded` \| `replaced` |
| recovery_value | Float? | Null until recovered |
| recovery_date | DateTime? | Null until recovered |

## Immutability Summary

| Field | Writable at creation | Writable later |
|---|---|---|
| InventoryItem.cost_price | ✅ | ❌ |
| LossEntry.loss_value | ✅ | ❌ |
| LossEntry.loss_date | ✅ | ❌ |
| LossEntry.loss_type | ✅ | ❌ |
| LossEntry.recovery_value | ❌ | ✅ (recovery endpoint) |
| LossEntry.recovery_date | ❌ | ✅ (recovery endpoint) |
| LossEntry.recovery_status | ❌ | ✅ (recovery endpoint) |

